                        "glosses": [
                            "to fast (abstain from food or drink)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc7da0f7-a416-49bd-b45c-65f28188bd25",
                                "sense_id": "ae20f46b-9f3f-3c8c-8e46-9c9009f074dd",
                                "text": "И сказал им Иисус: могут ли поститься сыны чертога брачного, когда с ними жених? Доколе с ними жених, не могут поститься,",
                                "translation": "And Jesus said to them, \"Can the wedding guests fast while the bridegroom is with them? As long as they have the bridegroom with them, they cannot fast.\"",
